- Always use Shopify schema instead of hardcoded content.
- Follow Dawn theme architecture.
- Prefer reusable sections and snippets.
- Never hardcode colors if they can be schema settings.
- Use Shopify Selling Plans instead of custom subscription logic.
- Use Variant Metafields when additional variant information is required.
- Use Metaobjects for scalable structured content.
- Use Shopify's image_url filter correctly.
- Maintain pixel-perfect parity with the provided Figma.
- Test for 1440px, 991, 768px, and 375px breakpoints.
- Ensure code is compatible with Theme Check.